  "notes": "{伸|の}ばす means to stretch, extend, or grow something.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{伸|の}びる→伸びる：01974_nobiru⟧ (intransitive - to stretch, grow)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{手|て}→手：00569_te⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{伸|の}ばす: to reach out one's hand\n- ⟦{髪|かみ}→髪：02196_kami⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{伸|の}ばす: to grow out one's hair\n- ⟦{背筋|せすじ}→背筋：13931_sesuji⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{伸|の}ばす: to straighten one's back\n- ⟦{能力|のうりょく}→能力：03541_nouryoku⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{伸|の}ばす: to develop one's abilities\n- ⟦{記録|きろく}→記録：02490_kiroku⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{伸|の}ばす: to extend a record\n\nKANJI DISTINCTION:\n- {伸|の}ばす: to stretch physically, to develop\n- ⟦{延|の}ばす→延ばす：28291_nobasu⟧: to extend, postpone (time, deadlines)",
